再大声点，你要在马背上大声喊出来。

797
00:32:46.360 --> 00:32:51.480
Okay, so first, this construction was not something that I had ever imagined for Dothraki.
好的，首先，这种结构是我从未为多斯拉克语设想过的。

798
00:32:51.760 --> 00:32:57.280
Whoever was a writer of this episode really kind of studied the grammar, and so they created
这一集的编剧真的研究过语法，所以他们创造了

