817
00:33:41.920 --> 00:33:42.480
Wow.
哇。

818
00:33:42.800 --> 00:33:43.960
Yeah, isn't that great?
是啊，这不是很棒吗？

819
00:33:44.320 --> 00:33:47.340
I am so impressed with our writers.
我对我们的编剧印象太深刻了。

820
00:33:47.600 --> 00:33:48.060
I know.
我知道。

821
00:33:48.260 --> 00:33:49.780
They don't phone anything in.
他们从不敷衍了事。

822
00:33:50.000 --> 00:33:56.120
And now part of the Dothraki language was created on The Office, a tiny part, but there's
