So many wax stamps and little confettis, Angela, all day.
安吉拉，整天都是火漆印章和碎纸屑。

961
00:38:59.680 --> 00:39:00.100
I know.
我知道。

962
00:39:00.100 --> 00:39:00.320
I know.
我知道。

963
00:39:00.420 --> 00:39:00.920
All day.
整天都是。

964
