01:09:57.140 --> 01:10:01.320
This might be a better title, but the better the titles, the stupider the job gets.
这可能是一个更好的头衔，但头衔越好，工作就越蠢。

1798
01:10:02.020 --> 01:10:07.120
Jim is now going to hypothetically offer Daryl a job doing sports marketing in Philly.
吉姆现在要假设性地给达里尔提供一份费城体育营销的工作。

1799
01:10:07.480 --> 01:10:08.000
Okay.
好的。

1800
01:10:08.220 --> 01:10:09.340
Hold on a second.
等一下。

1801
01:10:09.760 --> 01:10:13.860
Did Jim ask his business partner if it was okay to start hiring people?
吉姆有没有问过他的商业伙伴，开始招人是否妥当？

1802
01:10:14.160 --> 01:10:19.800
Does Jim just make giant life decisions and business decisions without consulting his partners?
吉姆是不是总在不咨询合伙人的情况下，就做出重大的生活和商业决策？

1803
01:10:21.060 --> 01:10:23.880
Jim, other people live in the world.
吉姆，这世界上还有别人呢。

1804
01:10:24.640 --> 01:10:25.000
Okay.
好吧。

1805
01:10:26.020 --> 01:10:27.100
You have a life.
你有你的生活。

1806
01:10:27.100 --> 01:10:28.480
You have a business partner.
你还有个商业伙伴。

1807
01:10:28.640 --> 01:10:30.380
You're just going to call him up and be like, hey, guess what?
你难道就打算直接打电话跟他说，嘿，你猜怎么着？

1808
01:10:30.400 --> 01:10:33.800
I know we don't have an office space yet, but I've hired an employee.
我知道我们还没办公室，但我已经雇了个员工。

1809
01:10:34.380 --> 01:10:38.240
Well, listen, Daryl's like, this isn't real, right?
嗯，听着，达里尔当时觉得，这事儿不是真的吧？

1810
01:10:38.340 --> 01:10:39.740
And Jim's like, no, it's happening.
吉姆就说，不，这是真的。

1811
01:10:39.740 --> 01:10:40.740
It really is.
确实是真的。

1812
01:10:40.860 --> 01:10:42.860
But we just got to keep it between us for now.
但我们目前得先保密。

1813
01:10:43.260 --> 01:10:48.420
And then Daryl hits Jim with the truth bomb, and he says, hey, it's not real until your
然后达里尔给了吉姆当头一棒，他说，嘿，除非你老婆同意，

1814
01:10:48.420 --> 01:10:49.340
wife is on board.
否则这事儿就不算数。

1815
01:10:50.220 --> 01:10:50.580
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1816
01:10:50.900 --> 01:10:51.300
What?
什么？

1817
01:10:52.000 --> 01:10:53.920
And Jim's like, hadn't thought of that.
吉姆当时就想，我还没考虑过这点。

1818
01:10:54.240 --> 01:10:59.060
I was just going to have a job in Philly and just, I don't know, tell Pam I was going to
我本来打算在费城找份工作，然后，我不知道，告诉帕姆我每天去

1819
01:10:59.060 --> 01:11:00.160
the doctor every day.
看医生。

1820
01:11:00.680 --> 01:11:03.420
Well, Jim is going to have a talking head now that would have come here.
好吧，吉姆现在要有个访谈镜头了，本来应该出现在这里的。

1821
01:11:03.580 --> 01:11:04.680
It's in deleted scenes.
在删减片段里。

1822
01:11:05.220 --> 01:11:08.280
And Brian, the boom operator, is going to call him out.
而且录音师布莱恩要当面拆穿他。

1823
01:11:08.480 --> 01:11:09.220
Let's hear it.
让我们听听看。

1824
01:11:09.860 --> 01:11:13.700
Yes, Pam and I did decide together that I would not take the job.
是的，我和帕姆确实一起决定过我不去那份工作。

1825
01:11:13.880 --> 01:11:17.100
So thank you, Brian, for reminding me.
所以谢谢你，布莱恩，提醒了我。

1826
01:11:18.220 --> 01:11:23.000
This is another moment where we're very aware that there's been a documentary crew this whole
这是另一个时刻，让我们非常清楚地意识到，一直以来都有个纪录片摄制组在场，

1827
01:11:23.000 --> 01:11:25.260
time, and they've seen everything.
他们目睹了一切。

1828
01:11:25.900 --> 01:11:29.680
Well, also at this moment, Nellie and Pam are going to get back to the office.
嗯，同样是在这个时刻，奈莉和帕姆要回到办公室了。

1829
01:11:30.080 --> 01:11:32.440
Nellie drives Pam's car into a hedge.
奈莉把帕姆的车开进了树篱里。

1830
01:11:32.620 --> 01:11:33.060
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1831
01:11:33.060 --> 01:11:38.480
To do this stunt, they put these pads behind the greenery, and we put the car in neutral,
为了拍这个特技，他们在绿植后面放了垫子，我们把车挂在空挡，

1832
01:11:38.480 --> 01:11:41.660
and a group of guys actually just pushed us into the fence.
然后一群人实际上只是把我们推向了栅栏。

1833
01:11:41.820 --> 01:11:42.020
Oh.
噢。

1834
01:11:43.320 --> 01:11:43.900
That's a lot.
那动静挺大的。

1835
01:11:43.900 --> 01:11:45.880
They did not make Catherine drive into a fence.
他们并没有让凯瑟琳真的开车撞向栅栏。

1836
01:11:45.940 --> 01:11:47.900
That's a lot less exciting.
那可就没那么刺激了。

1837
01:11:48.540 --> 01:11:48.840
Yes.
是的。

1838
01:11:48.840 --> 01:11:50.940
Just a few guys rolled you into the hedge.
只是几个人把你推进了树篱里。

1839
01:11:51.160 --> 01:11:55.020
And this is when Nellie and Pam go into the warehouse, and Nellie says,
这就是奈莉和帕姆走进仓库的时候，奈莉说，

1840
01:11:55.200 --> 01:11:57.280
what do you think about putting a mural here?
你觉得在这里画幅壁画怎么样？

1841
01:11:57.620 --> 01:11:58.980
And I want you to do it.
而且我想让你来画。

1842
01:11:59.480 --> 01:12:01.480
Pam is so excited.
帕姆非常兴奋。

1843
01:12:01.660 --> 01:12:02.020
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1844
01:12:03.060 --> 01:12:06.560
This was part of my storyline pitch that Pam's going to become a muraliSt.
这是我剧情构思的一部分，帕姆要成为一名壁画家。

1845
01:12:06.820 --> 01:12:08.520
I was very excited about it.
我对此感到非常兴奋。

1846
01:12:08.640 --> 01:12:12.780
But then, this is also where Pam finally gets the news.
但随后，这也是帕姆最终得知消息的地方。

1847
01:12:13.360 --> 01:12:18.140
Jim is now, I guess, emboldened by Daryl to be forthright.
我想吉姆现在在达里尔的鼓励下，变得坦诚了。

1848
01:12:18.300 --> 01:12:18.580
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1849
01:12:18.580 --> 01:12:21.940
Maybe because Brian called him out on it, too, we find out.
也许是因为布莱恩也当面指出了这一点，我们才发现的。

1850
01:12:22.140 --> 01:12:22.340
Yeah.
是的。

1851
01:12:22.340 --> 01:12:24.540
He says he'd like to talk to her for a second.
他说想跟她谈一谈。

1852
01:12:24.960 --> 01:12:26.720
And we kind of talked about this.
我们之前也聊过这个。

1853
01:12:26.900 --> 01:12:28.360
I think we know my feelings.
我想大家都知道我的感受。

1854
01:12:29.060 --> 01:12:30.760
Jim's like, what was I worried about?
吉姆心想，我之前在担心什么呢？

1855
01:12:30.940 --> 01:12:31.940
She's the beSt.
她真是太棒了。

1856
01:12:32.540 --> 01:12:33.940
There's layers here, lady.
这事儿没那么简单，女士。

1857
01:12:34.700 --> 01:12:36.260
Jim is instantly relieved.
吉姆瞬间如释重负。

1858
01:12:36.480 --> 01:12:38.600
Pam is still feeling unsettled.
帕姆心里还是不踏实。

1859
01:12:38.720 --> 01:12:39.140
Yeah.
没错。

1860
01:12:39.240 --> 01:12:39.640
As she should.
理应如此。

1861
01:12:39.640 --> 01:12:43.720
And this was, by the way, all of this is what we talked about in our pitch meetings,
顺便说一下，这些都是我们在提案会议上讨论过的内容，

1862
01:12:43.720 --> 01:12:50.600
about how let's expose some of the immaturities in Jim and Pam's marriage and relationship.
关于如何揭示吉姆和帕姆婚姻与关系中不够成熟的一面。

1863
01:12:50.880 --> 01:12:55.580
Some ways where maybe they aren't as good of communicators as we think.
在某些方面，他们可能并不像我们想象中那样善于沟通。

1864
01:12:55.580 --> 01:12:58.860
Well, this is also the thing that the writers struggled with, right?
嗯，这也是编剧们纠结的地方，对吧？

1865
01:12:59.000 --> 01:13:02.460
For Jim and Pam to have conflict, but it wasn't breakup conflict.
吉姆和帕姆之间要有冲突，但不能是导致分手的冲突。

1866
01:13:02.460 --> 01:13:03.860
It was like passive conflict.
那是一种消极的冲突。

1867
01:13:04.080 --> 01:13:05.500
It wasn't affair conflict.
不是因为出轨产生的冲突。

1868
01:13:05.860 --> 01:13:06.020
Yeah.
没错。

1869
01:13:06.400 --> 01:13:09.220
And John and I were really excited about this because we thought,
约翰和我对此感到非常兴奋，因为我们觉得，

1870
01:13:09.380 --> 01:13:11.800
this is the stuff that real marriages go through.
这才是真实婚姻中会经历的事情。

1871
01:13:12.000 --> 01:13:12.260
Yeah.
没错。

1872
01:13:12.440 --> 01:13:15.120
You know, this is the clunky kind of stuff.
你知道，这就是那种琐碎又笨拙的事情。

1873
01:13:15.360 --> 01:13:15.720
Yeah.
没错。

1874
01:13:16.040 --> 01:13:18.140
That isn't like, I'm cheating on you.
不是那种“我出轨了”的戏码。

1875
01:13:18.220 --> 01:13:18.900
It's career.
而是关于事业。

1876
01:13:19.200 --> 01:13:19.820
It's kids.
关于孩子。

1877
01:13:19.820 --> 01:13:21.220
It's making a mortgage.
关于还房贷。

1878
01:13:21.260 --> 01:13:22.580
It's all of those things.
就是所有这些琐事。

1879
01:13:22.920 --> 01:13:23.400
Communication.
沟通问题。

1880
01:13:23.740 --> 01:13:23.940
Yeah.
没错。

1881
01:13:23.940 --> 01:13:27.720
Well, the episode is going to end on a sweet note, I think.
嗯，我觉得这一集会以温馨的基调收尾。

1882
01:13:28.280 --> 01:13:29.660
Everyone's leaving for the day.
大家都要下班离开了。

1883
01:13:29.920 --> 01:13:32.500
And Pete says goodbye to Aaron and Dothraki.
皮特跟亚伦和多斯拉克语女孩说了再见。

1884
01:13:32.800 --> 01:13:33.180
Yeah.
没错。

1885
01:13:33.300 --> 01:13:34.560
He didn't know what it was earlier.
他之前还不知道那是什么。

1886
01:13:34.560 --> 01:13:35.640
He was confused.
他当时很困惑。

1887
01:13:35.940 --> 01:13:36.180
Yeah.
没错。

1888
01:13:36.180 --> 01:13:37.500
But he's so delighted by her.
但他被她深深吸引了。

1889
01:13:37.640 --> 01:13:40.960
He went and learned a little phrase so he could say goodbye to her.
他特意去学了一句短语，好跟她道别。

1890
01:13:41.680 --> 01:13:43.340
And then Andy says, you know what?
然后安迪说，你知道吗？

1891
01:13:43.340 --> 01:13:44.300
I like that guy.
我挺喜欢那小子的。

1892
01:13:44.460 --> 01:13:45.720
We should set him up with Meredith.
我们应该撮合他和梅雷迪斯。

1893
01:13:46.500 --> 01:13:49.320
I am crushing on Pete in this episode.
这一集里我完全被皮特迷住了。

1894
01:13:49.320 --> 01:13:53.860
I totally see why he was named one of our pop culture treasures of the week.
我完全明白为什么他会被评为我们本周的流行文化瑰宝之一。

1895
01:13:53.940 --> 01:13:54.480
Yeah.
没错。

1896
01:13:54.660 --> 01:13:55.640
He's a sweetie pie.
他真是个甜心。

1897
01:13:55.860 --> 01:13:57.340
And you can't help but root for him.
你很难不为他加油。

1898
01:13:57.440 --> 01:13:57.860
I know.
我知道。

1899
01:13:58.140 --> 01:14:00.620
And he's being sweet to Aaron and I like it.
而且他对亚伦很好，我很喜欢这一点。

1900
01:14:00.880 --> 01:14:03.040
She's had two real weirdo boyfriends.
她之前交的两个男朋友都挺怪的。

1901
01:14:03.660 --> 01:14:04.120
Yeah.
没错。

1902
01:14:04.680 --> 01:14:06.360
So I'm liking this.
所以我很喜欢这个。

1903
01:14:07.080 --> 01:14:09.500
Well, that was Andy's ancestry.
嗯，那是安迪的祖先。

1904
01:14:09.860 --> 01:14:10.460
It was.
确实是。

1905
01:14:10.660 --> 01:14:13.280
Thank you so much, Steve Burgess, for all your good stuff.
非常感谢你，史蒂夫·伯吉斯，感谢你带来的所有精彩内容。

1906
01:14:13.280 --> 01:14:15.120
Angela's loving the call sheets.
安吉拉很喜欢这些通告单。

1907
01:14:15.400 --> 01:14:16.060
Loving them.
非常喜欢。

1908
01:14:16.240 --> 01:14:18.160
And next week is Work Bus.
下周是《工作巴士》那一集。

1909
01:14:18.380 --> 01:14:20.340
Get ready for those call sheets.
准备好迎接那些通告单吧。

1910
01:14:20.540 --> 01:14:21.160
Oh, boy.
天哪。

1911
01:14:21.400 --> 01:14:22.700
So you don't want to miss it.
所以你一定不想错过。

1912
01:14:22.800 --> 01:14:23.880
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1913
01:14:23.960 --> 01:14:24.460
See you then.
到时候见。

1914
01:14:24.600 --> 01:14:25.220
Have a good one.
祝你过得愉快。

1915
01:14:30.430 --> 01:14:32.390
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

1916
01:14:32.730 --> 01:14:36.810
Office Ladies is produced by Earwolf, Jenna Fisher, and Angela Kinsey.
《办公室女士》由Earwolf、珍娜·费舍尔和安吉拉·金赛制作。

1917
01:14:36.810 --> 01:14:39.210
Our senior producer is Cassie Jerkins.
我们的高级制作人是卡西·杰金斯。

1918
01:14:39.370 --> 01:14:41.470
Our in-studio engineer is Sam Kiefer.
我们的演播室工程师是萨姆·基弗。

1919
01:14:41.610 --> 01:14:43.870
Our editing and mixing engineer is Jordan Duffy.
我们的剪辑和混音工程师是乔丹·达菲。

1920
01:14:44.030 --> 01:14:46.190
And our associate producer is Ainsley Bubico.
我们的助理制作人是安斯利·布比科。

1921
01:14:46.470 --> 01:14:49.350
Our theme song is Rubber Tree by Creed Bratton.
我们的主题曲是克里德·布拉顿演唱的《橡胶树》。
